$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Omikrass 015" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midnight" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have set up massive ground bases on a deserted desert planet. They battle for control and to prove which may be the superior Tribe. They plan to do this by seeing who could capture the others flag and siccessfully bringing it back to their own. May the best tribe prove superior within these Base Battles!!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Lisa W.  (XGN LadyShar) Pick up all the Xtreme Gaming maps and map packs at www.xtremetribes.net";